        <member name="P:Kevin.Web.Basics.Controllers.AI.OpenAI.OpenAICompatibleChatRequest.User">
            <summary>会话标识（OpenAI 标准字段）：客户端传同一个值即复用同一会话，作为会话键的最后兜底来源</summary>
        </member>
        <member name="P:Kevin.Web.Basics.Controllers.AI.OpenAI.OpenAICompatibleChatRequest.ConversationId">
